```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Set total = 0; scoreNumber = 1]
    B --> C{Is scoreNumber <= 25?}
    C -- Yes --> D[/Input score/]
    D --> E[total = total + score]
    E --> F[scoreNumber = scoreNumber + 1]
    F --> C
    C -- No --> G[average = total / 25]
    G --> H[/Display average/]
    H --> I([End])
```
